                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "My biggest gripe with this game is that it cannot be played alone and two copies are needed to play with a friend or partner. Thankfully it's not an expensive game and it's enjoyable enough that one can forget this complaint. I liked the puzzles and found them logical and not overly difficult or easy, I also liked that there can be jumpscares to this game depending on how high one's fear tolerance is. I admit, I did give my friend a certain route I knew was creepy. I'm kind like that! Overall I recommend this game because while it is short and not the best puzzle game out there, it can make at least one fun afternoon!",
